### Marketing Lead Desk: requests that prove the API (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio .http)
### Needs Features:Marketing=true (on in appsettings.Development.json) and Seed:MarketingDemoPassword set.
@host = http://localhost:5298
@password = <the value of Seed:MarketingDemoPassword>

### 1. Sign in as the demo user (OTP-exempt in Development, so the token comes back directly)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userType": "Marketing", "userName": "marketing.demo@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 2. Fixed lists
GET {{host}}/api/marketing/lookups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. The work queue returns Sofia Marino
# @name queue
GET {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/queue?sort=score&dir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@leadId = {{queue.response.body.$.data[0].id}}

### 4. Her detail: 4 history entries, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/marketing/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Pick up (a second pick-up, or another user's, answers 409)
POST {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/{{leadId}}/pick-up
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Log an email with a file
POST {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/{{leadId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----mk

------mk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="kind"

Email sent
------mk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="occurredAt"

2026-11-18T09:00:00Z
------mk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="subject"

Case study from a law firm
------mk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="body"

Hi Sofia, here is the case study.
------mk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="case-study.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Case study text
------mk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="filesMeta"

[{"fileName":"case-study.txt","signedBy":null,"signedAt":null}]
------mk--

### 8. Change stage, score, close, return
PUT {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/{{leadId}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stage": "Interested" }

###
PUT {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/{{leadId}}/score
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 92 }

###
POST {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/{{leadId}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/{{leadId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Not interested" }

### 9. A user WITHOUT the Marketing role gets 403 (sign in as an Employee, then call any endpoint)
# @name employee
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userType": "Employee", "userName": "<an employee email>", "password": "<their password>" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{employee.response.body.$.data.token}}

### No token: 401
GET {{host}}/api/marketing/leads/queue
